# ADR-0026: the driven declare attackers step runs the declaration itself
# (CR 508.1, a turn-based action before priority). ai has no creature, so
# no block is asked for (CR 509.1). No creature has first strike, so the
# first-strike damage step deals nothing and grants no priority
# (PhaseHandler.java:321-332). The combat damage step deals 2 (CR 510.2).
# Seven steps from Untap: Upkeep, Main1 (turn 1 skips the draw step, CR
# 103.7a), BeginCombat, Declare Attackers, Declare Blockers, First Strike
# Damage, Combat Damage.
startturn human
queue attackers 1
queue attacktarget ai
step 7
